      {
        "number": 10,
        "internalPageId": null,
        "title": "We can use the modals to indicate different meanings in messages.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "We can use the modals to indicate different meanings in messages.",
          "Functions Examples 1 Suggestions They should not talk loud. 2 Responsibility She has to finish his homework. 3 Obligation I must act normal before her. 4 Prohibition You must not hit your sister. You can’t yell at your mum.",
          "To consider 1. There are other uses for each of the modals. 2. Can also works with abilities."
        ],
